  sentences:
    nameNPC: "Ng\xF4 V\u0103n Ch\u1EA5n"
    Lines:
    - "Ch\xFAa c\xF4ng ta n\xF3i: 'Tr\u1EADn v\u1EEBa r\u1ED3i, \u0110inh c\xF4ng
      t\u1EED tuy thua v\u1EC1 binh l\u1EF1c, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng thua v\u1EC1 kh\xED
      th\u1EBF v\xE0 t\xE0i n\u0103ng. Ta kh\xF4ng mu\u1ED1n l\xE0m k\u1EBB th\xF9
      v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 t\xE0i. Ta mu\u1ED1n m\u1EDDi c\xF4ng t\u1EED
      v\u1EC1 B\u1ED1 H\u1EA3i, c\xF9ng b\xE0n chuy\u1EC7n thi\xEAn h\u1EA1.'"
